@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Analysis — Material identity and access
hide methods
left to right direction
class CourseFamily <<entity>>
class Course <<entity>>
class EditionLabel <<value>>
class MaterialOccurrence <<entity>>
class ContentGroup <<value>>
class AuthorDeclaration <<value>>
class PublicationGrant <<entity>>
CourseFamily "1" -- "0..*" Course
Course "1" -- "0..1" EditionLabel
Course "1" -- "0..*" MaterialOccurrence
MaterialOccurrence "0..*" -- "1" ContentGroup
MaterialOccurrence "1" -- "1" AuthorDeclaration
PublicationGrant "0..*" -- "1" Course
EditionLabel -[hidden]down-> MaterialOccurrence
ContentGroup -[hidden]down-> AuthorDeclaration
note bottom of ContentGroup : A search identity, without separate binary ownership.
@enduml
